1 0 obj<</Author(MalachiWalker)/CreationDate(D:20261101021532+00'00')/Creator(calibre \(9.17.0\) [https://calibre-ebook.com])/Keywords(Fanworks, Teen And Up Audiences, She-Ra and the Princesses of Power \(2018\), Adora/Catra \(She-Ra\), Lonnie/Scorpia \(She-Ra\), Adora \(She-Ra\), Catra \(She-Ra\), Glimmer \(She-Ra\), Bow \(She-Ra\), Lonnie \(She-Ra\), Micah \(She-Ra\), Back on the romcom train my dudes, Fluff and humor and a touch of angst-oh my!, The aftermath of the reunion, Some drama necessary, Catra and Adora try to reasonable adults while rebuilding their relationship, Everyone else just wants them to kiss already, And they were yearning, OH MY GOD THEY WERE YEARNING, Speculations on Magicat biology and culture because s4 refused to feed me, feat. Glimmer and Lonnie as Chaos Gremlin and Queen of the Barbecue respectively, Here to roast the hell out of their respective best friends for making this complicated, -bangs gong like a midieval herald-, "THERE SHALL BE NO SMOOCHING UNTIL THE PROPER PINING RITUALS ARE COMPLETE", Catra actually goes to therapy, -smacks fic- This baby can fit so much cuddling and PDAs in it, I know what I'm about y'all, F/F, No Archive Warnings Apply, Kyle/Rogelio \(She-Ra\), Rogelio \(She-Ra\), Kyle \(She-Ra\), Scorpia \(She-Ra\), "NOT A STANDALONE FIC")/ModDate(D:20261101021532+00'00')/Producer(calibre \(9.17.0\) [https://calibre-ebook.com])/Title(So Difficult, So Simple \(And Still It Feels Like Coming Home\))>>
endobj
