<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">So Difficult, So Simple (And Still It Feels Like Coming Home)</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;After ten long years and one climactic reunion, Catra Leandros and Adora Eternia have reunited and are giving the concept of "us" another shot.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;But of course, that's a little easier said than done, as the two struggle to consolidate the old with the new, endure the ruthless dragging of their friends, and try to rebuild their trust in the face of a few long-buried secrets. Because nothing can ever be simple with these two involved.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>MalachiWalker</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
      <dc:subject>
        <rdf:Bag>
          <rdf:li>Fanworks</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Teen And Up Audiences</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>She-Ra and the Princesses of Power (2018)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora/Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Lonnie/Scorpia (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Glimmer (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Bow (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Lonnie (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Micah (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Back on the romcom train my dudes</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Fluff and humor and a touch of angst-oh my!</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>The aftermath of the reunion</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Some drama necessary</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra and Adora try to reasonable adults while rebuilding their relationship</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Everyone else just wants them to kiss already</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>And they were yearning</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>OH MY GOD THEY WERE YEARNING</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Speculations on Magicat biology and culture because s4 refused to feed me</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>feat. Glimmer and Lonnie as Chaos Gremlin and Queen of the Barbecue respectively</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Here to roast the hell out of their respective best friends for making this complicated</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>-bangs gong like a midieval herald-</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>"THERE SHALL BE NO SMOOCHING UNTIL THE PROPER PINING RITUALS ARE COMPLETE"</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra actually goes to therapy</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>-smacks fic- This baby can fit so much cuddling and PDAs in it</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>I know what I'm about y'all</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>F/F</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>No Archive Warnings Apply</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Kyle/Rogelio (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Rogelio (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Kyle (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Scorpia (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>"NOT A STANDALONE FIC"</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Bag>
      </dc:subject>
      <dc:publisher>
        <rdf:Bag>
          <rdf:li>Archive of Our Own</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Bag>
      </dc:publisher>
      <dc:date>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>2019-12-31T21:00:00-03:00</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:date>
      <dc:language>
        <rdf:Bag>
          <rdf:li>en</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Bag>
      </dc:language>
    </rdf:Description>
